        sections=[{'body': 'Black gram (Vigna mungo)\n\nBlack gram can be grown in rice fallows and uplands.', 'heading': 'Overview'}, {'body': 'Pure crop 20 kg/ha; Mixed crop 6 kg/ha.', 'heading': 'Seed rate'}, {'body': 'Plough the land 2-3 times thoroughly and remove weeds and stubbles. For seed treatment in black gram, two Rhizobium cultures viz. KAU-BG-2 and BG-12 are recommended.', 'heading': 'Sowing'}],
        source_reference='KAU Package of Practices Recommendations: Crops 2024 (16th ed.)',
