        plant_protection='',
        harvesting='For green leaf purposes, the shrub should be kept low by pruning or lopping at a height of 2-3 m. The shrub can be pruned two or three times a year and it withstands repeated lopping. Within two years after planting, the plants are ready for lopping.',
        expected_yield='Each plant gives 5 to 10 kg of green leaves annually.',
