        sections=[{'body': 'Horse gram (Macrotyloma uniflorum)\n\nHorse gram can be grown in paddy nurseries after transplantation of the second crop and in palliyal lands after harvest of first crop and uplands during rabi season.', 'heading': 'Overview'}, {'body': '25-30 kg/ha', 'heading': 'Seed rate'}, {'body': 'After land preparation, sow the seeds either dibbled in rows 25 cm apart or by broadcast.', 'heading': 'Sowing'}],
