        sections=[{'body': 'Kattarvazha is known as kumari in Sanskrit (Aloe vera). The leaves are used for medicinal purpose. It is grown well in open areas receiving good amount of sunlight. The suckers are used for propagation. The field is ploughed to a fine tilth.', 'heading': 'Overview'}],
